WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.150
What’s the deepest desire of SCP-507, the
tragically lovable Reluctant Dimension Hopper?

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.880
He was photographed with the Desire Camera
while he ate in the cafeteria, and the photo

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.710
depicted him conversing with Foundation researchers
over lunch, while dressed as a Foundation

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:15.710
researcher.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:20.300
Like many of us, it seems SCP-507 just wants
a stable job…

